    "Everything you've recorded is still on this iPhone, and nothing was changed. Try again in a moment. If it keeps happening, check that your iPhone has some free storage." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ό,τι έχεις καταγράψει είναι ακόμα σε αυτό το iPhone και δεν αλλάξαμε τίποτα. Δοκίμασε ξανά σε λίγο. Αν συνεχίσει, δες αν το iPhone έχει ελεύθερο χώρο."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Everything you've recorded is still on this iPhone, and nothing was changed. Try again in a moment. If it keeps happening, check that your iPhone has some free storage."
